This README file contains a brief description of the verification case.

A simple test for a 1mm x 1mm x 1mm case with only 1 element. The temperature keeps constant with
a fast flux of 5e19 n/cm²/s, so that the fluence reache 5e25 n/m² at 100s.
The radial and tangential strain were then compared with the Bison result taken from:
https://mooseframework.inl.gov/bison/source/materials/tensor_mechanics/PyCCEGAIrradiationEigenstrain.html.

The verification results are shown in figure BAF1.036 and BAF1.063
